<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Self-Improving LLM Agents at Test-Time" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Additional Run-time Overhead and Resource Usage Analysis</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In Appendix H Additional Run-time Overhead and Resource Usage Analysis ‣ Self-Improving LLM Agents at Test-Time" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Use of LLMs</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
